# 💬 OPIc Expression - Day17

## Today's Expression

### One thing I noticed was...

Meaning:

제가 느낀 점 중 하나는 ~였어요.

---

## When to Use

어떤 장소나 상황에서 경험한 특징을 설명할 때 유용하다.

특히 OPIc에서

장소 묘사
경험 설명
여행
학교
일상생활

등에 활용할 수 있다.

---

## Examples

One thing I noticed was that the place was very crowded.

One thing I noticed was that people were really friendly.

One thing I noticed was that the public transportation was very convenient.

---

## Useful Pattern

One thing I noticed was that + 문장

Example:

One thing I noticed was that the city was much quieter at night.

---

## Pro Tip

단순히

"The city was crowded."

라고 말하는 것보다

"One thing I noticed was that the city was really crowded, especially during rush hour."

처럼 **관찰 + 구체적인 상황**을 추가하면 답변이 풍부해진다.
